# Rebuild, don't re-tailor

When the candidate has edited `onepager.yaml` / `appendix.md` / `cover-letter.md` and wants PDFs updated, run **only**:

```
node scripts/rebuild.mjs
```

Pass the open file path or variant slug if you know it. Then stop.

Do not run `/tailor`. Do not rewrite bullets, headlines, or evidence. Do not apply the one-page cut order. Report overflow or YAML errors and wait for the human to edit the source.
